OL,3,GNEWSAPony dies after getting caught in
OL,4,Arope used for swing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pony has died after being caught in a
OL,7,Frope used to make a swing at a national
OL,8,Fpark.
OL,10,FThe animal is believed to have become
OL,11,Fentangled at a site near Lyndhurst in
OL,12,Fthe New Forest, Hampshire, before
OL,13,Fspending a night trying to free itself.
OL,14,FIt was found on Saturday.
OL,16,FThe accident has prompted warnings
OL,17,Fabout the danger makeshift rope swings
OL,18,Fpose to wildlife.
OL,20,FAuthorities in the national park said
OL,21,Frope swings could also be dangerous to
OL,22,Fhumans as trees were liable to break.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
